                         INTO WS-KEY-CHAR
               END-STRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       FORMAT-BROKER-ID-0064.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       COMPUTE-COLOUR-0065.
